; Underlines and strike-outs over glyphs whose outlines run either way or
; have no orientation, in an embedded face assembled with
;   cargo xtask fonts assemble --embed orientation-contours.ttf
;     harness/fonts/probes/orientation-contours.probe OUTPUT
; (A clockwise, B reversed, C and D an outer contour and hole each way, E
; areas that cancel, F a single point, G zero area, H, I and J figure eights,
; K and L curves, M a reversed outer contour round a hole, N no points, O
; zero advance): alone, between clockwise glyphs, emboldened, slanted, with
; a border, and from the style.
